        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hugh \"Hughie\" Clifford\n- Organizations: Liverpool F.C.\n- Places: Liverpool, Merseyside, England\n- Topics: Scottish football, association football, club honors\n\nFacts:\n- Hugh \"Hughie\" Clifford was a Scottish footballer who lived from 1866 to 1929.\n- Hugh \"Hughie\" Clifford played for Hibernian, Stoke, Celtic, Motherwell, Liverpool, and Manchester City.\n- Liverpool Football Club is a professional association football club based in Liverpool, Merseyside, England.\n- Liverpool Football Club has won 5 European Cups, 3 UEFA Cups, 3 UEFA Super Cups, 18 League titles, 7 FA Cups, 8 League Cups, and 15 FA Community Shields.\n- Liverpool Football Club holds English records for 5 European Cups and 8 League Cups.",
